    "title": "PrideStar Trinity EMS Helps Provide AED to Honor Gym Owner's Legacy - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WHAV News Staff ,\n1 hours ago PrideStar Trinity EMS recently joined with the family and friends of the late Edge 24 Hour Private Fitness owner Paul Newt to equip the Dracut gym with an Automated External Defibrillator, or AED. Newt suffered a sudden cardiac emergency last October at his gym and immediately received emergency lifesaving efforts... Read full article",
